  <section class="hero section" id="hero">
<div class="container">
<div class="split-grid split-grid--hero">
<div class="hero__content">
                <span class="badge badge--primary">27th Edition &bull; June 23-25, 2027</span></p>
<h2 class="hero-title" style="font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 4vw, 3.4rem); line-height: 1.15; margin: 1rem 0 1.25rem;">
                    BIS 2027:<br />
                    <span style="color: var(--primary);">Business Information Systems</span><br />
                </h2>
<p class="hero-lead" style="font-size: 1.15rem; color: var(--text-body); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 2rem; max-width: 620px;">
                    BIS is a renowned international conference on business information systems. BIS 2027 will be the 27th in a series of international conferences. From the very beginning it has been recognized by scientists and business practitioners as a forum for the exchange and dissemination of topical research in the development, implementation, application, and improvement of computer systems for business.                </p>
<div class="hero-actions" style="display: flex; gap: 1rem; flex-wrap: wrap;">
                    <a href="http://bisconf.org/2027/call-for-papers/" class="btn btn--primary btn--lg"><br />
                        <span>Submit Your Research</span><br />
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"></polyline></svg><br />
                    </a><br />
                    <a href="https://bisconf.org/2027/about-bis/" class="btn btn--secondary btn--lg">Explore More</a>
                </div>
</p></div>
<div class="hero__deadlines">
<div class="hero__deadlines-logo" style="margin-bottom: 1.25rem;">
